    "WellSpent will ask for this bank's full transaction history again, starting now. Transactions you deleted will come back. Ones already imported won't be duplicated. Available once a day per bank.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WellSpent will ask for this bank's full transaction history again, starting now. Transactions you deleted will come back. Ones already imported won't be duplicated. Available once a day per bank."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WellSpent le pedirá a este banco todo su historial de transacciones otra vez, empezando ahora. Las transacciones que eliminaste volverán a aparecer. Las ya importadas no se duplicarán. Disponible una vez al día por banco."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a period ends, roll its balance into the next one. Money left over is added to Savings; if you overspent, the shortfall is split across the payment methods you spent it on, so the debt shows where it came from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a period ends, roll its balance into the next one. Money left over is added to Savings; if you overspent, the shortfall is split across the payment methods you spent it on, so the debt shows where it came from."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando termina un período, traslada su saldo al siguiente. El dinero que sobra se suma a Ahorros; si te pasaste, la diferencia se reparte entre los métodos de pago con los que gastaste, para que la deuda muestre de dónde viene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
